WEBVTT

00:05:29.992 --> 00:05:32.203
The only way for us to build,

00:05:32.244 --> 00:05:36.374
to truly build a world where people
can truly find belonging,

00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:40.252
is to start with healing.

00:05:43.297 --> 00:05:44.548
Thank you.

00:05:44.548 --> 00:05:48.761
(Cheers and applause)